ay in releasing Rs. 4,034 crore in MGNREGA dues to Tamil Nadu. For over four and a half months, 91 lakh workers, 86% of them women, and 29% from SC/ST communities, and 1 lakh differently-abled persons, have been denied their rightful wages due to this unjustified hold-up. Tamil Nadu has consistently been a top performer in MGNREGA, yet the Union Government continues to withhold funds despite repeated appeals, including from our Hon\\u2019ble CM", "repeated appeals, including from our Hon\\u2019ble CM mkstalin . I strongly urge the union government to immediately release pending MGNREGA wages. #DMKinParliament", "#WATCH | Delhi: On ruckus and adjournment of Parliament over Karnataka Deputy CM DK Shivakumar\'s reported statement on the Constitution, Congress MP Manickam Tagore says, \\"We all know that BJP wants to block the Parliament, they don\'t have any bills to be discussed in Parliament...the discussion that happened in Karnataka Assembly can\'t be part of the Parliament...BJP and Parliamentary Affairs Minister are not allowing the Parliament to run. It is very unfortunate...\\"", "\\u0b87\\u0bb0\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bc1 \\u0ba4\\u0bc7\\u0b9a\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bc1 \\u0ba4\\u0bc1\\u0bb0\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bc1 \\u0bae\\u0ba9\\u0bbf\\u0ba4\\u0bb0\\u0bcd \\u0b9f\\u0bc6\\u0bb2\\u0bcd\\u0bb2\\u0bbf \\u0baa\\u0baf\\u0ba3\\u0bae\\u0bcd! \\u0bae\\u0ba9\\u0bbf\\u0ba4\\u0bb0\\u0bcd \\u0b89\\u0ba3\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0ba8\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bc1 \\u0b95\\u0bca\\u0bb3\\u0bcd\\u0bb3, \\u0b87\\u0ba4\\u0bc1 \\u0bae\\u0ba9\\u0bbf\\u0ba4 \\u0b95\\u0bc2\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0ba3\\u0bbf \\u0b85\\u0bb2\\u0bcd\\u0bb2!! \\u0b85\\u0ba4\\u0bc8\\u0baf\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0ba4\\u0bbe\\u0ba3\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0bbf \\u0b95\\u0bc7\\u0bb5\\u0bb2\\u0bae\\u0bbe\\u0ba9\\u0ba4\\u0bc1 \\ud83d\\udca6 #AdmkFails", "Submitted a notice of question of privilege against Shri Kiren Rijiju, Minister of Parliamentary Affairs, for blatantly misleading the House on March 24, 2025. Mi