a and Bangladesh share a deep, historic relationship, rooted in our joint efforts for Bangladesh\\u2019s independence and strengthened by decades of mutual growth and cooperation. I highlighted how Bangladesh\\u2019s remarkable economic progress, reflected in its rising per capita income and growing trade ties with", "per capita income and growing trade ties with India, is a testament to its resilience and dynamism. Tamil Nadu and Bangladesh share a unique bond, anchored in a deep love for our mother tongues and cultural identity. This shared affinity continues to strengthen our ties, with Chennai already a key destination for medical tourism from Bangladesh \\u2013 and the recent announcement of the 4th daily flight between Dhaka and Chennai. As economic and people-to-people exchanges grow, our relationship is bound to", "exchanges grow, our relationship is bound to deepen further. On behalf of our Hon\'ble Chief Minister, Thiru. mkstalin , the Government, and the people of Tamil Nadu, I extended my best wishes to the people of Bangladesh on this momentous occasion.", "\\u0bae\\u0bbe\\u0ba3\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bbf\\u0b95\\u0bc1 \\u0b95\\u0bb4\\u0b95\\u0baa\\u0bcd \\u0baa\\u0bca\\u0ba4\\u0bc1\\u0b9a\\u0bcd\\u0b9a\\u0bc6\\u0baf\\u0bb2\\u0bbe\\u0bb3\\u0bb0\\u0bcd \'\\u0baa\\u0bc1\\u0bb0\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b9a\\u0bbf\\u0ba4\\u0bcd \\u0ba4\\u0bae\\u0bbf\\u0bb4\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\' \\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0bb0\\u0bc1. \\u0b8e\\u0b9f\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bbe\\u0b9f\\u0bbf\\u0baf\\u0bbe\\u0bb0\\u0bcd \\u0b85\\u0bb5\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bbf\\u0ba9\\u0bcd \\u201c\\u0baf\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bbe\\u0ba4\\u0bbf \\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0bb0\\u0bc1\\u0ba8\\u0bbe\\u0bb3\\u0bcd\\" \\u0bb5\\u0bbe\\u0bb4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bc1\\u0b9a\\u0bcd \\u0b9a\\u0bc6\\u0baf\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bbf. #Ugadi2025", "\\u0ba4\\u0b99\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bc1\\u0b9f\\u0bc8\\u0baf \\u0ba4\\u0bcb\\u0bb2\\u0bcd\\u0bb5\\u0bbf\\u0baf\\u0b9f\\u0bc8\\u0ba8\\u0bcd\\u0ba4 \\u0b86\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b9a\