\ud83c\\udf04 Senior", "commitment in our #KovaiRising manifesto \\ud83c\\udf04 Senior officials from across departments participated as we discussed design concepts, capacity planning, and multi-functional usage \\u2014 including concerts and large-format events, ensuring inclusive and holistic development. What started as a sports infrastructure promise is now shaping up to be a landmark that will symbolise Coimbatore\\u2019s rising aspirations. This stadium is now bigger, better, and bolder \\u2014 all thanks to the clarity of purpose and drive of our", "thanks to the clarity of purpose and drive of our Honourable Deputy CM. Under the visionary leadership of Honourable Chief Minister of Tamil Nadu Thiru. MK Stalin avargal, Tamil Nadu is not just enabling economic growth, but also investing in world-class public infrastructure that enriches the everyday lives of our people through sports, culture and entertainment. What we promise, we deliver ! #KovaiRising #DravidianModel", "Indian textiles walked so global fashion could run. Watch Full Exclusive: https://youtu.be/VZm4C1tiQlM?si=SZK6dRr0QRD2eIKc", "\\u0bae\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0baf \\u0baa\\u0bbe\\u0b9c\\u0b95 \\u0b85\\u0bb0\\u0b9a\\u0bbe\\u0bb2\\u0bcd \\u0ba8\\u0bbe\\u0b9f\\u0bbe\\u0bb3\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0ba9\\u0bcd\\u0bb1 \\u0b87\\u0bb0\\u0bc1 \\u0b85\\u0bb5\\u0bc8\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bbf\\u0bb2\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0ba8\\u0bbf\\u0bb1\\u0bc8\\u0bb5\\u0bc7\\u0bb1\\u0bcd\\u0bb1\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b9f \\u0bb5\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bc1 \\u0bb5\\u0bbe\\u0bb0\\u0bbf\\u0baf \\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0bb0\\u0bc1\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4 \\u0b9a\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bc8 \\u0b8e\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bc1, \\u0ba4\\u0bae\\u0bbf\\u0bb4\\u0b95\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0bb5\\u0bb0\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0baa\\u0bbf\\u0bb0\\u0ba4\\u0bae\\u0bb0\\u0bcd \\u0ba8\\u0bb0\\u0bc7\\u0ba8\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0bb0 \\u0bae\\u0bcb\\u0b9f\\u0bbf \\u0b85\\u0bb5\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\