 #ProtectStateRights", "A defining victory for our leader, Hon\\u2019ble Chief Minister Thiru. mkstalin, in his fight to uphold Tamil Nadu\\u2019s constitutional rights. Tamil Nadu Governor #RNRavi withheld assent to Bills passed by the democratically elected Legislative Assembly, blocking the will of the people. Challenging this undemocratic blockade, Thalaivar #MKStalin approached the Supreme Court on behalf of the #DravidianModel government. Today, the Supreme Court has spoken: \\u201cWithholding assent to ten Bills is unconstitutional. All", "assent to ten Bills is unconstitutional. All Bills must be approved.\\u201d Our Hon\\u2019ble Chief Minister has dedicated this triumph to all states standing up for their rights within the Union, saying, \\"This judgment is not just a win for Tamil Nadu. It is a powerful victory for every state that believes in federalism and democratic governance.\\" The Governor must now reflect on his role, respect democratic norms, and recognise the voice of the people. As champions of democracy, let us celebrate this hard-fought", "of democracy, let us celebrate this hard-fought victory. #\\u0ba4\\u0bae\\u0bbf\\u0bb4\\u0bcd\\u0ba8\\u0bbe\\u0b9f\\u0bc1\\u0baa\\u0bcb\\u0bb0\\u0bbe\\u0b9f\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd_\\u0ba4\\u0bae\\u0bbf\\u0bb4\\u0bcd\\u0ba8\\u0bbe\\u0b9f\\u0bc1\\u0bb5\\u0bc6\\u0bb2\\u0bcd\\u0bb2\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd", "\\u0b92\\u0bb0\\u0bc7 \\u0bb8\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bc0\\u0b9a\\u0bcd\\u0bb2 \\u0b8e\\u0b99\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bc8 \\u0bae\\u0bc1\\u0b9f\\u0bbf\\u0b9a\\u0bcd\\u0b9a\\u0bc1 \\u0bb5\\u0bbf\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0bc1\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0bc0\\u0b99\\u0bcd\\u0b95 \\u0baa\\u0bcb\\u0b99\\u0bcd\\u0b95..!", "\\u0b85\\u0bae\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bc7\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb0\\u0bcd \\u0b8e\\u0bb4\\u0bc1\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0baf \\u0b85\\u0bb0\\u0b9a\\u0bbf\\u0baf\\u0bb2\\u0bcd \\u0b9a\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0ba4\\u0bbe\\u0ba9\\u0bcd \\u0b87\\u0ba8\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0baf\\u0bbe\\u0bb5\\u0bbf\\u0bb1\\u0bcd