ns to a few. The TN Space Industrial Policy has been crafted with inputs from several industry experts like senior IIT Professors to enable brilliant startups like Agnikul etc. By throwing silly and baseless allegations you are delegitimising and discouraging the great work done by these experts and", "the great work done by these experts and startups in this sector. Why insult our space scientists and entrepreneurs for cheap political brownie points? It\'s one thing to be a political opponent but it\'s an entirely different thing when one dashes to the pharmacy to pick up a litre of antacid everytime the Government of Tamil Nadu does something phenomenal to chart a bigger and brighter future for the people of TamilNadu ! It\'s one thing to lack intelligence but it\'s an entirely different level to be", "but it\'s an entirely different level to be utterly heartless trying to stain the effort of the government, scientists and entrepreneurs who are trying to uplift youngsters by creating a new ecosystem for research and development. Its one thing to be a sore loser cribbing and sobbing for days but an entirely different thing to attempt to wreck the very home one lives in and in the process wreck the lives of thousands of hardworking youngsters who are toiling to create a better world ! We understand your", "to create a better world ! We understand your pain, You thought the crown was yours. But the people had their say, and closed your final doors. Keep crying if you must, Tamil Nadu walks ahead. Get well soon da Aadu and Adimais \\ud83d\\ude07 #SpaceTech #InvestInTN", "\\u0bae\\u0bbe\\u0ba3\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bbf\\u0b95\\u0bc1 \\u0ba4\\u0bae\\u0bbf\\u0bb4\\u0bcd\\u0ba8\\u0bbe\\u0b9f\\u0bc1 \\u0bae\\u0bc1\\u0ba4\\u0bb2\\u0bae\\u0bc8\\u0b9a\\u0bcd\\u0b9a\\u0bb0\\u0bcd \\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0bb0\\u0bc1. mkstalin \\u0b85\\u0bb5\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bbf\\u0ba9\\u0bcd \\u0bae\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bbf\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0