sion is clear: innovation", "the solutions. Our vision is clear: innovation must not remain limited to urban centres like Chennai. Cities like Coimbatore, Madurai, Tirunelveli, and Salem must emerge as vibrant hubs of inclusive, globally competitive innovation. With initiatives like these, Tamil Nadu continues to invest in a future where opportunities are decentralised, cutting-edge ideas are supported, and young talent is empowered."], "model": "voyage-multilingual-2", "input_type": "document", "truncation": true, "output_dtype": "float", "output_dimension": 1024, "encoding_format": "base64"}' message='Post details'
