\u0bbf\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bbf\\u0bb1\\u0bc7\\u0ba9\\u0bcd.", "Warm birthday wishes to Hon\\u2019ble CM of Uttar Pradesh, Shri myogi_adityanath Ji. Praying for your good health, happiness, and long life.", "11 years of transformative and inspirational leadership..! A journey of 11 years towards Viksit Bharat, under our Hon\\u2019ble Prime Minister Shri. narendramodi ji, has shown us what development truly looks like..! Our Hon\\u2019ble Prime Minister has fulfilled every commitment for the past decade, and continues to work round the clock for the nation\\u2019s welfare. We couldn\\u2019t have asked for a better leader to take our country to newer and unparalleled heights. #11YearsOfGaribKalyan", "11YearsOfYuvaShakti \\u2014 a decade of empowering youth under the visionary leadership of Hon\\u2019ble PM Shri narendramodi ji. From Skill India to Startup India, Digital India to PMKVY \\u2014 these transformative initiatives have opened lakhs of career pathways and nurtured a generation of confident, self-reliant youth. India\\u2019s rise in medical colleges, startup ecosystem, and women-led progress in STEM reflects a deeper movement \\u2014 one of purpose, pride & potential. Heartfelt tributes to Bharat\\u2019s Yuva Shakti - the driving", "tributes to Bharat\\u2019s Yuva Shakti - the driving force of #ViksitBharat. #11YearsOfYuvaShakti #AmritKaal", "\\u0baa\\u0bbf\\u0bb0\\u0ba4\\u0bae\\u0bb0\\u0bcd \\u0bae\\u0bcb\\u0b9f\\u0bbf\\u0baf\\u0bbf\\u0ba9\\u0bcd \\u0ba8\\u0bc6\\u0bb0\\u0bc1\\u0b99\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bbf\\u0baf \\u0ba8\\u0ba3\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bb0\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd, \\u0b87\\u0ba8\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0baf\\u0bbe\\u0bb5\\u0bbf\\u0ba9\\u0bcd \\u0b87\\u0bb0\\u0ba3\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0bbe\\u0bb5\\u0ba4\\u0bc1 \\u0baa\\u0bc6\\u0bb0\\u0bbf\\u0baf \\u0baa\\u0ba3\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bbe\\u0bb0\\u0bb0\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bbe\\u0ba9 \\u0b95\\u0bcc\\u0ba4\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0b85\\u0ba4\\u0bbe\\u0ba9\\u0bbf\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc1 \\u0b9a\\u0bca\\u0ba8\\u0bcd\\u0b