2026-01-28 16:47:46,728 [DEBUG] voyage - data='{"input": ["The #Census delay is no accident. The #delimitation plan is no coincidence. The danger I warned of is at our doorstep. #FairDelimitation #OraniyilTamilNadu \\ud83d\\uded1 There is a sinister design in how the BJP-led Union Government is implementing the national Census and the subsequent #delimitation. Developed states, especially in the non-Hindi speaking South, which followed population control norms, will now be punished. \\ud83d\\uded1 Meanwhile, states that disregarded population control for decades are set to gain more seats", "control for decades are set to gain more seats in Parliament. This unfair shift skews the federal balance and rewards irresponsibility. \\ud83d\\uded1 I had already warned about this design. Thiru PChidambaram_IN has now explained in detail how this sleight of hand is unfolding. Time has come not just to be vigilant but to craft counter-strategies to safeguard the South\\u2019s voice. \\ud83d\\uded1 The 2027 Census will form the basis for the next delimitation, replacing the 1971 data. This gives the Union BJP Government the means to", "This gives the Union BJP Government the means to restructure parliamentary representation to its advantage, at the cost of the southern states. \\ud83d\\uded1 The Ministry of Home Affairs claims that the concerns of affected states will be addressed. But these are vague remarks. What is needed is a clear parliamentary commitment and a suitable constitutional amendment. \\ud83d\\uded1 Just look at what happened after Article 370 was abrogated. The Union Government spoke of restoring statehood to Jammu and Kashmir. Elections were", "statehood to Jammu and Kashmir. Elections were held. Assurances were given in the Supreme Court. Yet, Jammu and Kashmir remains a Union Territory. This is the track record of BJP we are dealing with. \\ud83d\\uded1 If the Union Government proceeds with delimitation based on 2027 census, the democratic power of peninsular India will be reduced to irrelevance. \\ud83d\\uded1 Even if betrayers like the ADMK choose to kneel before the BJP for their political survival, the people of Tamil Nadu led by the DMK will never allow our state", "Nadu led by the DMK will never allow our state to be punished for its progress. Tamil Nadu will fight! Tamil Nadu will win!", "\\u0baa\\u0bb9\\u0bb2\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bbe\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0baa\\u0baf\\u0b99\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb0\\u0bb5\\u0bbe\\u0ba4\\u0ba4\\u0bcd \\u0ba4\\u0bbe\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc1\\u0ba4\\u0bb2\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bcd \\u0b95\\u0bbe\\u0bb0\\u0ba3\\u0bae\\u0bbe\\u0ba9 \\u0ba4\\u0bc0\\u0bb5\\u0bbf\\u0bb0\\u0bb5\\u0bbe\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bcd \\u0b87\\u0ba9\\u0bcd\\u0ba9\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0b95\\u0bc8\\u0ba4\\u0bc1 \\u0b9a\\u0bc6\\u0baf\\u0bcd\\u0baf\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0b9f\\u0bb5\\u0bbf\\u0bb2\\u0bcd\\u0bb2\\u0bc8. \\u0b85\\u0bb5\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bcd \\u0b87\\u0bb0\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bbf\\u0b9f\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0b85\\u0b9f\\u0bc8\\u0baf\\u0bbe\\u0bb3\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0b95\\u0bbe\\u0ba3\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0b9f\\u0bb5\\u0bbf\\u0bb2\\u0bcd\\u0bb2\\u0bc8. \\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0b9f\\u0bc0\\u0bb0\\u0bc6\\u0ba9 \\u0baa\\u0bcb\\u0bb0\\u0bcd \\u0b85\\u0bb1\\u0bbf\\u0bb5\\u0bbf\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0ba4\\u0bc1, \\u0baa\\u0bcb\\u0bb0\\u0bcd \\u0ba8\\u0b9f\\u0ba8\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0ba4\\u0bc1, \\u0baa\\u0bcb\\u0bb0\\u0bcd \\u0ba8\\u0bbf\\u0bb1\\u0bc1\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0ba4\\u0bc1. \\u0b87\\u0bb5\\u0bc8 \\u0b95\\u0bc1\\u0bb1\\u0bbf\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bc1 \\u0b92\\u0ba9\\u0bcd\\u0bb1\\u0bbf\\u0baf \\u0baa\\u0bbe\\u0b9c\\u0b95 \\u0b85\\u0bb0\\u0b9a\\u0bc1 \\u0b9a\\u0bb0\\u0bbf\\u0baf\\u0bbe\\u0ba9 \\u0bb5\\u0bbf\\u0bb3\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bc8 \\u0b87\\u0ba9\\u0bcd\\u0ba9\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0b9a\\u0bca\\u0bb2\\u0bcd\\u0bb2\\u0bb5\\u0bbf\\u0bb