ou letting farmers suffer without announcing a fair Minimum Support Price #MSP for their produce? 4.", "Minimum Support Price #MSP for their produce? 4. Why do you consistently deny rightful financial allocations to non BJP ruled states like #TamilNadu? Why abandon them even during natural disasters such as floods? 5. Why have you never faced the #press to date? What are you afraid of? 6. Why is there no funding for research on #Keezhadi or for the development of the Tamil language, while #Sanskrit continues to receive privileged financial support? 7. Why do you engage in politics that vilify #minorities,", "you engage in politics that vilify #minorities, portraying them as enemies in their own country in the name of #religion? 8. Why are you attempting to erode India\\u2019s diversity by imposing #Hindi on us? 9. Why do you penalise the poor by extracting charges in the name of Minimum Balance, while simultaneously writing off massive corporate loans? 10. Why did you deceive the people with the promise of depositing \\u20b915 lakh in every account by eliminating black money? Why did you subject the poor to untold misery", "Why did you subject the poor to untold misery through the sham of demonetisation? 11. Why have you turned institutions like the #CBI, ED, and IT Department into Lapdogs of the BJP, thereby destroying public trust in them? #BJPFails", "\\u0b92\\u0ba9\\u0bcd\\u0bb1\\u0bbf\\u0baf\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0bb2\\u0bcd \\u0b86\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b9a\\u0bbf\\u0baa\\u0bcd \\u0baa\\u0bca\\u0bb1\\u0bc1\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bc7\\u0bb1\\u0bcd\\u0bb1\\u0bc1 11 \\u0b86\\u0ba3\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bc8 \\u0ba8\\u0bbf\\u0bb1\\u0bc8\\u0bb5\\u0bc1 \\u0b9a\\u0bc6\\u0baf\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bc1\\u0bb3\\u0bcd\\u0bb3 \\u0baa\\u0bbf\\u0bb0\\u0ba4\\u0bae\\u0bb0\\u0bcd \\u0ba8\\u0bb0\\u0bc7\\u0ba8\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0bb0 \\u0bae\\u0bcb\\u0b9f\\u0bbf \\u0b85\\u0bb5\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc1 \\u0bae\\u0b95\\u0bcd\