 greetings and heartfelt appreciation. Every year, when our volunteers receive Certificates of Appreciation from district collectors for donating the highest number of units, we NTKians feel a deep sense of honor and"], "model": "voyage-multilingual-2", "input_type": "document", "truncation": true, "output_dtype": "float", "output_dimension": 1024, "encoding_format": "base64"}' message='Post details'
